<title>UK: London offshore tea auction offerings.</title>
<headline>London offshore tea auction offerings.</headline>
<text>
<p>Offshore offering for the Oct 21 London Tea Auction Totalled 800 packages of 53.50 kgs against 1,800 pkgs on Oct 14.</p>
<p>							   Last	  Prev</p>
<p>Kenya O/Sh Pkgs	    CIF   Offshore	 200	   800</p>
<p>Zimba. O/Sh Pkgs	   CIF   Offshore	 400	   800</p>
<p>Uganda O/Sh Pkgs	   CIF   Offshore	 200	   200</p>
<p>Oct 21 landed packages already listed totalled 7,159.</p>
</text>
